ration, bounded caches, source-preserving label composition, styled[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]search, theme invalidation, and the language hint. Exercise explicit [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]test inputs while leaving existing producers inert.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Enable all pager entry points and verify the finished [/bold #D7AFFF]        [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]experience[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]activate_and_verify[dim] · [dim][/dim]after language_contract, syntax_engine, [/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#AF87FF][dim]reading_surface[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]activate_and_verify: propagate real source provenance, support [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]recognized source paths, add syntax controls and config, honor color [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]policy, document behavior, and complete functional, PNG, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]responsiveness verification.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-xz","llm_provider":"grok","model":"grok-4.6","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-xz.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-0c686da52983cddc214c05bfe3a23464","started_at":"2026-09-07T14:53:20.647605+00:00","state":"active"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":["prompt"],"restartable":false},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"7cd2cfcb7133a5e1e3c8dfea2e0c471c81b0f9a374ea734a1129b281c10738df","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-xz.land--mon-1/chat.md","size_bytes":102084},"commits":{"digest":"f79a7e94d40eadf058776d6b82b8d45b300a4aba01e5a15ca16f2937ecb5e2f5","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-xz.land--mon-1/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"meta":{"digest":"f0fe505db897466302a6306eae2ad8252f05af894351bbe4828b7eb9979d785c","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-xz.land--mon-1/meta.json","size_bytes":654},"state":{"digest":"823ff7c8b7779f0cf4616